# A shorted scene-light harness: the PDM trips, firmware retries with
# back-off, then locks the channel out. AUX clears it once repaired.
@0      ignition on
@200    press scene
@1000   expect pdm.2.current > 5
@1100   fault short 2 on
@1300   expect pdm.2.tripped == 1
@10000  expect uart "LOCKED OUT"
@10000  expect pdm.2.duty == 0
@10000  expect pdm.5.current > 3            # other channels unaffected
@10100  fault short 2 off
@10200  press aux
@11500  expect pdm.2.tripped == 0
@11500  expect pdm.2.current > 5
